    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c466d5eee15ff2584ff99b1"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Now that this is over, I will miss Kamea complaining around in the corridors and Alex jumbling while attempting some physical task for the first time on his life.\n\nAll these years under Aurigan contract felt like it lasted forever.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 2,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ccb4040059154328871ca15"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2e18f7ea7e6ad807f16f04"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "At the same time, being present to watch her coronation made it all worthwhile, despite what we had to do to achieve it. \n\nWe spent all these years so close to the Aurigans that now I can feel some hope after all they've gone through.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c5ab5e41f8e25e1356ccbbb"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2f0ef7edec2241e18dd19b"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "A tremendous wrong has been righted and we managed to be lucky to survive the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAuriganCivilWar],civil war]] and the [[DM.Factions[faction_HarbingersOfDoom],Harbinger]] invasion.\n\nAnd if it wasn't for her my family and friends would have been slaughtered by the [[DM.Factions[faction_TaurianConcordat],Taurians]] on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreArtru],Artru]], so Lady Arano will ever have my gratitude.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ccd6b80a3cea4007fc74c26"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c308136a0a2cba5c4eaabec"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "But the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAuriganReach],Reach]] is still in a quite precarious position, despite the coronation ceremony serving as a union for everyone that will hopefully heal the wounds of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAuriganCivilWar],civil war]].\n\nAnd seeing the damage inflicted on so many worlds... many will never [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreReapersScore],recover]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c1d9b9f3e8974ecdd3804f8"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca8b53155fd6c72e24c4992"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It's one thing to have heard about Periphery brutality, another to experience it fully.\n\nIt's contrary to the laws of warfare and human decency to deliberately target civilians to clear systems like the Taurians and Commodore Ostergaard did.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c07bb078c841f4436b08811"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cdce423628b6c3fb10b62d1"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Whom they are claiming now that he acted against orders to justify the loss of the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDropShipIberia],Iberia]]</i>. \n\nWhich also justifies not having to provide explanations about how his son was sent to eliminate Kamea, or the backroom deals with the [[DM.Factions[faction_AuriganDirectorate],Directorate]] before their falling out.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "And they will even get to put Director Espinosa on trial for war crimes.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb6f416e0c47fb9db4dbe99"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cdfb7fef3deca34ad1f451d"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Overall the Taurians were the victors of the Aurigan Civil War. \n\nBesides pushing the Aurigans away from their antispinward border, they have also took worlds for the Concordat and mostly demilitarized the Reach for the next decades.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cd6278d96470b0be9614434"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c335d950abd964bd4563b71"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "What about the Harbingers and other [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDeepPeriphery],Deep Periphery]] raiders?\n\nWe stopped them at Coromodir, although I would call it barely a draw, but what if they resurface again, here or elsewhere?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c22da1589cedf068acb9f78"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c64c62c643b013943c4fc65"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "No one in the Inner Sphere isn't paying any attention to reports of lostech 'Mechs raiding the Periphery when dozen of worlds are burning because of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Lore4thSuccessionWar],war]] and millions have died in the advances and raids so far.\n\nAnd we don't know what truly made the Harbingers stop their raid on Coromodir, perhaps only them or Captain Murray give that answer.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cdde17ce6a655b33ad36f72"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c38f615391309a7b78b4b30"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I suspect it's not just that, Farah. Looking over the Directorate's intelligence reports provided by Colonel Faust, I couldn't find any reference to attacks made by those LosTech 'Mechs until they invaded the Reach.\n\nEven though we encountered them quite a few times before.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c3b63ad88fbc4eabba3a260"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c0915011d607fa641b83b62"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Alexander also searched IE's records and found that they are quite rare to occur during three hundred years since the fall of the Star League.\n\nSo, whomever is responsible for the Harbingers and those LosTech 'Mechs, they know how to keep hidden at the fringes of known space.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ce34903df8721d7fda5c379"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
