    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c96315ca809942602931184"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Something is out there in the dark, ready to strike at us, this sounds like another episode of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHolovidPeripheryTales],Periphery Tales]].\n\nAny more news on what might happened to Captain Murray?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c42e7b49dd509c0d32dab68"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c3d5a39f82f1ad1854cdf24"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "We found her BattleMech's escape pod empty, although with traces of blood, so she's being listed as MIA.\n\nSince none of the Satan's Kittens survived the attack on the planet, either she's still here or the Harbingers took her with them when they boarded their DropShips and left Coromodir.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c67e099037096f8f1771903"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cfdfc937c81db13cedc0357"
      },
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Still no idea why she took off to meet the Harbinger leadership at their landing zone or what she said to them from her cockpit?\n\nMost likely she was telling them to 'fuck off' or something similar in their language. ",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 15,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c79e41c9f15f9cc43162603"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
