      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c61063435f8f235e82db6f4"
      },
      "index": 17,
      "text": "But the official story will be that both of them were hiding in a Periphery backwater, where we dealt with religious zealots, pirate raiders and Directorate assassins.\n\nWhich wasn't much different of what happened and as for our time in the Magistracy and with 'Bob', it's better not to advertise that at all.",
      "branches": [
        {
